WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:03.383
Unit sixteen. Consent and Respect!

2
00:00:04.308 --> 00:00:07.849
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.899 --> 00:00:11.077
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.127 --> 00:00:14.677
Today we learn about Consent and Respect. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:19.162
Consent. Say it with me. Consent!

6
00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:26.001
Permission. Say it with me. Permission!

7
00:00:29.512 --> 00:00:32.912
Respect. Say it with me. Respect!

8
00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.760
Boundaries. Say it with me. Boundaries!

9
00:00:43.297 --> 00:00:46.364
No. Say it with me. No!

10
00:00:49.815 --> 00:00:53.099
Pressure. Say it with me. Pressure!

11
00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.383
Body language. Say it with me. Body language!

12
00:01:03.834 --> 00:01:06.884
Trust. Say it with me. Trust!

13
00:01:10.387 --> 00:01:20.444
Consent means giving clear permission. Respect means accepting someone's boundaries, even when they say no. Pressure is not consent, and paying attention to body language builds trust.

14
00:01:20.494 --> 00:01:23.279
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:24.809 --> 00:01:29.870
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.070
Respect!

17
00:01:32.031 --> 00:01:36.940
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.164
Body language!

19
00:01:39.295 --> 00:01:44.477
Did you know? Consent can be changed at any time — a 'yes' earlier can become a 'no'!

20
00:01:44.527 --> 00:01:46.645
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.018 --> 00:01:55.535
Think and answer. Why is pressure not the same as consent?

22
00:01:55.585 --> 00:01:56.735
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.778 --> 00:02:02.184
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.234 --> 00:02:04.868
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

